# Entries about NOVA itself. Checked against ui.html, Logic.classify, Timers, Driving (v22 code).
E = [
("nova-what-is", ["nova voice assistant kya hai", "what is the nova assistant", "nova app kya kaam karta hai", "nova assistant kya kar sakta hai", "what can the nova app do", "nova ke baare mein batao"],
 "NOVA ek Android voice assistant hai. Wake word bolne par ye torch, volume, apps, timer jaise phone ke kaam khud kar deta hai, aur zyadatar kaam bina internet ke chalte hain. AI keys optional hain.",
 "NOVA is a voice assistant app for Android. After the wake word it does phone tasks like torch, volume, apps and timers, and most of them work without the internet. AI keys are optional.", ["nova"]),
("nova-wake-word", ["wake word kaise badlein", "how to change the wake word", "nova ka naam kaise badalte hain", "wake word kya hota hai", "jagane wala shabd kaise badlein", "change wake word in settings"],
 "Settings mein WAKE WORD box mein naya shabd likho: sirf English akshar, ek shabd, 3 se 12 akshar, aur wo Vosk dictionary mein hona chahiye. SAVE ke baad STOP dabake dobara ACTIVATE karo. Shabd na mila to NOVA khud nova use karega.",
 "In Settings type a new word in the WAKE WORD box: English letters only, one word, 3 to 12 letters, and it must be in the Vosk dictionary. After saving press STOP and then ACTIVATE again. If the word is not found NOVA falls back to nova.", ["nova"]),
("nova-offline-works", ["nova bina internet ke kya kya karta hai", "what works offline in nova", "offline mein nova kya kar sakta hai", "internet na ho to nova kaam karega kya", "does nova work without internet", "nova offline commands"],
 "Bina internet ke torch, volume, brightness, battery, samay aur tarikh, app kholna, timer, calculation, unit badalna aur pehli madad ke jawab chalte hain. Lambe khule sawal aur web search ke liye internet aur key chahiye.",
 "Without internet these work: torch, volume, brightness, battery, time and date, opening apps, timers, calculations, unit conversion and first-aid answers. Long open questions and web search need the internet and a key.", ["nova"]),
("nova-no-key-needed", ["kya nova chalane ke liye api key chahiye", "does nova need an api key", "nova activate karne ke liye key zaroori hai kya", "bina key ke nova chalega", "nova ke liye key kyun chahiye", "is an api key required for nova"],
 "Nahi. ACTIVATE karne aur phone commands ke liye koi key nahi chahiye. Key sirf lambe sawaal, web search aur deep screen analysis jaise optional kaam ke liye hai.",
 "No. You need no key to activate NOVA or to run phone commands. A key is only for optional things like long questions, web search and deep screen analysis.", ["nova"]),
("nova-gemini-key", ["gemini api key kaise daalte hain", "how to add a gemini key in nova", "gemini key kahan daalni hai", "nova mein api key save kaise karein", "gemini key ka istemal kya hai", "keys save kaise karein"],
 "Settings mein GEMINI API KEYS box mein key paste karo (ek line mein ek key) aur KEYS SAVE dabao. Key Android Keystore mein encrypted rehti hai aur screen par wapas nahi dikhti.",
 "In Settings paste your key into the GEMINI API KEYS box (one key per line) and press KEYS SAVE. The key is stored encrypted in the Android Keystore and is never shown again.", ["nova"]),
("nova-groq-key", ["groq key kya hai", "groq key kyun daalein", "what is the groq key for", "hindi samajhne ke liye kaun si key daalein", "groq save kaise karein", "better hindi listening ke liye kya karein"],
 "Groq key Hindi aur Hinglish behtar samajhne ke liye hai. GROQ KEY box mein paste karke GROQ SAVE dabao. Key hone par aapki awaaz internet se Groq ko jaati hai, aur wahi key free online text jawab mein bhi kaam aati hai.",
 "The Groq key helps NOVA understand Hindi and Hinglish better. Paste it in the GROQ KEY box and press GROQ SAVE. With a key saved your voice goes over the internet to Groq, and the same key also serves the free online text answers.", ["nova"]),
("nova-free-online-ai", ["free online ai kya hai", "nova ka free ai kaise kaam karta hai", "what is free online ai in nova", "groq openrouter pollinations kya hai", "free ai on karne se kya hota hai", "bina gemini ke nova jawab kaise deta hai"],
 "FREE ONLINE AI box mein switch ON karo to Gemini na ho ya fail ho jaye tab NOVA Groq, OpenRouter aur Pollinations try karta hai. Sirf aapka bola hua sawaal text mein jaata hai. Pakka free rasta Groq ya OpenRouter key hai; Pollinations bina key fail ho sakta hai.",
 "Switch ON the FREE ONLINE AI box and, when Gemini is missing or fails, NOVA tries Groq, OpenRouter and Pollinations. Only your spoken question is sent, as text. The sure free route is a Groq or OpenRouter key; Pollinations without a key can fail.", ["nova"]),
("nova-privacy", ["nova mera data kahan bhejta hai", "is nova private", "nova privacy kaisi hai", "does nova upload my data", "nova kya cloud par bhejta hai", "mera data nova ke saath safe hai kya"],
 "Phone commands, shortcuts aur yaad ki baatein phone ke andar hi rehti hain. Screen ka text tabhi jaata hai jab aap bolo analyze screen aur key ho. Online AI ko sirf aapka sawaal jaata hai.",
 "Phone commands, shortcuts and remembered facts stay on the phone. Screen text is sent only when you say analyze screen and a key exists. Online AI gets only your question.", ["nova", "privacy"]),
("nova-analyze-screen", ["analyze command kya karta hai", "what does the analyze command do", "nova display ka deep analysis kaise karta hai", "deep analysis kab hota hai", "nova mere display ko kab padhta hai", "analyse command ka matlab"],
 "Analyze screen sirf tab chalta hai jab aap khud bolo, aur AI key ho. Tab password-free screen text AI ko jaata hai. Iske liye Accessibility ON honi chahiye.",
 "Analyze screen runs only when you say it yourself and an AI key exists. Then password-free screen text goes to the AI. Accessibility must be ON for it.", ["nova", "privacy"]),
("nova-confirm-yes", ["nova kaam karne se pehle poochta kyun hai", "why does nova ask yes or no", "risky kaam ke pehle haan kyun bolna padta hai", "nova ki confirmation kaise kaam karti hai", "nova ka yes confirmation kitni der rehta hai", "call karne se pehle nova kya poochta hai"],
 "Call ya WhatsApp bhejne jaise risky kaam se pehle NOVA bol kar poochta hai aur sirf aapka saaf haan sunkar hi karta hai. Saaf na ho to ise na maana jata hai. Jawab ke liye 30 second milte hain.",
 "Before risky actions like a call or sending a WhatsApp message NOVA asks aloud and acts only on a clear spoken yes. An unclear answer counts as no. You have 30 seconds to answer.", ["nova", "safety"]),
("nova-timer-help", ["nova se timer kaise lagayein", "how to set a timer with nova", "timer lagane ka tareeka kya hai", "nova reminder kaise lagate hain", "timer ke liye kya bolna chahiye", "nova mein countdown kaise chalayein"],
 "Bolo: nova set a timer for five minutes, ya nova do minute ka timer laga do. Timer phone ke Clock app se chalta hai isliye NOVA so bhi raha ho to bajta hai. Alarm cancel karna abhi supported nahi hai.",
 "Say: nova set a timer for five minutes, or nova do minute ka timer laga do. The phone's Clock app runs it, so it rings even if NOVA is asleep. Cancelling an alarm is not supported yet.", ["nova"]),
("nova-shortcuts", ["nova shortcut kaise seekhta hai", "nova ka shortcut kya hota hai", "how does nova learn shortcuts", "shortcut banau ka matlab kya hai", "nova naye shortcut kaise banata hai", "nova memory clear kaise karein"],
 "Aap koi phrase baar baar bolte ho to NOVA poochta hai ki shortcut bana du. Haan bolo to hi save hota hai. Shortcuts sirf phone mein rehte hain; Settings mein CLEAR MEMORY se sab hat jaate hain.",
 "If you often say a phrase, NOVA asks whether to save it as a shortcut. It is saved only if you say yes. Shortcuts stay on the phone, and CLEAR MEMORY in Settings removes them all.", ["nova"]),
("nova-personal-memory", ["nova ko kuch yaad kaise rakhwayein", "how to make nova remember something", "nova mujhe kya yaad hai kaise poochein", "nova bhool ja kaise bolein", "personal memory kaise kaam karti hai", "nova ki yaad ki baatein kahan save hoti hain"],
 "Bolo: nova yaad rakh mera naam Shiv hai; dekhne ke liye nova mujhe kya yaad hai; hatane ke liye nova bhool ja mera naam ya nova sab bhool ja. Ye sirf phone mein rehta hai, aur password, OTP, PIN, card ya ID number NOVA yaad nahi rakhta.",
 "Say: nova yaad rakh mera naam Shiv hai; to see it say nova mujhe kya yaad hai; to remove it say nova bhool ja mera naam or nova sab bhool ja. It stays on the phone only, and NOVA does not keep passwords, OTPs, PINs, cards or ID numbers.", ["nova"]),
("nova-quiet-mode", ["nova jawab bolta kyun nahi", "how to hear nova replies aloud", "quiet mode kya hai", "nova ki awaaz mein jawab kaise sunein", "voice replies chalu kaise karein", "nova chup kyun hai"],
 "Shuru mein jawab chat mein dikhte hain, bole nahi jaate. Bolwane ke liye kaho voice replies on ya quiet mode off. Phir se chup karne ke liye quiet mode on kaho.",
 "By default replies are shown in the chat and not spoken. To hear them say voice replies on or quiet mode off. To silence them again say quiet mode on.", ["nova"]),
("nova-driving-mode", ["gaadi chalate waqt nova kaise use karein", "nova drive karte waqt messages kaise padhta hai", "how does nova help while driving", "gaadi chalate waqt messages kaise sunein", "nova se message kaise padhwayein", "read messages aloud while driving"],
 "Bolo driving mode on. Phir NOVA WhatsApp, Telegram aur Messages ke naye message padhta hai (read messages). Jawab ke liye reply driving, reply busy ya reply likho bolo, aur bhejne se pehle aapka haan chahiye; band karne ke liye driving mode off.",
 "Say driving mode on. NOVA then reads new messages from WhatsApp, Telegram and Messages (read messages). To answer say reply driving, reply busy or reply likho, which needs your yes before sending; say driving mode off to stop.", ["nova"]),
("nova-stop-words", ["nova ko chup kaise karayein", "how to make nova stop talking", "nova bol raha hai usse kaise rokein", "stop chup ruko kya karta hai", "nova ki awaaz band kaise karein", "nova ko beech mein kaise rokein"],
 "Bolo stop, chup ya ruko. NOVA turant bolna band kar deta hai. Home screen par CHUP button bhi hai.",
 "Say stop, chup or ruko and NOVA stops speaking at once. There is also a CHUP button on the home screen.", ["nova"]),
("nova-accessibility", ["accessibility on kaise karein", "how to enable accessibility for nova", "accessibility ka kya fayda hai nova mein", "restricted settings allow kaise karein", "nova ko accessibility permission kaise dein", "why does nova need accessibility"],
 "Accessibility Home, Back, tap aur screen padhne jaise kaam ke liye hai. Android 13+ par pehle APP INFO mein jao, upar teen dot dabao, Allow restricted settings chuno. Phir ACCESSIBILITY ON KARO mein NOVA ko ON karo.",
 "Accessibility is for tasks like Home, Back, tapping and reading the screen. On Android 13+ first open APP INFO, tap the three dots and choose Allow restricted settings. Then use ACCESSIBILITY ON KARO and turn NOVA on.", ["nova"]),
("nova-keep-alive", ["nova background mein band ho jata hai", "nova ko hamesha chalu kaise rakhein", "how to keep nova running in the background", "nova apne aap band kyun ho jata hai", "phone nova ko kill kar deta hai kya karein", "nova ka notification kyun dikhta hai"],
 "Ye aam Android salah hai: NOVA ka notification chalne dein, app ki power setting Unrestricted karein, aur kuch brands (Xiaomi, Oppo, Vivo, Samsung) mein Autostart ya background allow karein. Menu ke naam brand ke hisaab se badalte hain.",
 "This is general Android advice: let NOVA's notification stay, set the app's power usage to Unrestricted, and on some brands such as Xiaomi, Oppo, Vivo and Samsung allow autostart or background activity. Menu names vary by brand.", ["nova"]),
("nova-permissions", ["nova kaun kaun si permissions maangta hai", "what permissions does nova need", "contacts brightness popup permission kya hai", "nova permissions kyun maangta hai", "allow contacts allow brightness kab dabayein", "nova ki permission list"],
 "Mic aur notification ke alawa baaki permissions tabhi maangi jaati hain jab aap Settings mein tap karo: ALLOW CONTACTS (naam se call ya message), ALLOW BRIGHTNESS (roshni badalna) aur ALLOW POPUP.",
 "Apart from the microphone and notifications, permissions are asked only when you tap them in Settings: ALLOW CONTACTS (call or message by name), ALLOW BRIGHTNESS (change brightness) and ALLOW POPUP.", ["nova"]),
("nova-update-center", ["update center kya hai", "nova ko update kaise karein", "how does nova update itself", "nova ka sha 256 check kya hai", "update feed kya hota hai", "nova naya skill kaise add karta hai"],
 "NOVA khud kuch install nahi karta. Ye aapke diye feed link par naya skill, model ya app dhundta hai, pehle aapse poochta hai aur SHA-256 check hone ke baad hi add karta hai. App install ke liye ALLOW APP INSTALL chahiye.",
 "NOVA never installs anything by itself. It looks for a new skill, model or app at the feed link you give, asks you first and adds it only after the SHA-256 check passes. Installing an app needs ALLOW APP INSTALL.", ["nova"]),
("nova-offline-model", ["offline brain kya hai", "nova ka offline model kaise download karein", "what is the offline model in nova", "qwen offline model kya hai", "bina internet ke ai jawab kaise milein", "offline brain download kitna bada hai"],
 "Optional offline model (Qwen2.5-0.5B, lagbhag 491 MB) Update Center mein OFFLINE BRAIN se Wi-Fi par download hota hai. Ye chhota model hai, galti kar sakta hai aur kabhi koi kaam khud nahi karta.",
 "The optional offline model (Qwen2.5-0.5B, about 491 MB) downloads over Wi-Fi from OFFLINE BRAIN in the Update Center. It is small, can make mistakes and never performs any action by itself.", ["nova"]),
("nova-self-test", ["self test kya hai", "nova ka sab test karo kaise chalayein", "how to run the nova self test", "sab test karo button kya karta hai", "nova sahi chal raha hai ye kaise check karein", "self test mein kya hota hai"],
 "Settings mein SELF TEST ke SAB TEST KARO se chalao. Ye lagbhag 40 second leta hai: torch ek second jalegi, volume thoda badhega-ghategi aur Settings screen khulke wapas aayegi, par koi call, message ya payment nahi hota. COPY REPORT ya SHARE se report bhej sakte ho.",
 "Run it from SAB TEST KARO in the SELF TEST box in Settings. It takes about 40 seconds: the torch lights for a second, the volume moves a little and a Settings screen opens and closes, but no call, message or payment is made. Use COPY REPORT or SHARE to send the report.", ["nova"]),
("nova-screen-monitoring", ["monitoring feature kya hota hai nova mein", "monitoring feature ko on kaise karein", "what is the monitoring feature in nova", "nova mere display par error kaise batata hai", "monitoring ka matlab kya hai", "monitoring local hai ya cloud"],
 "Screen monitoring shuru mein OFF rehti hai. ON karne par ye phone ke andar hi screen par error ya warning dekhkar bol deta hai; kuch bhi cloud par nahi jaata. Iske liye Accessibility ON honi chahiye.",
 "Screen monitoring is OFF by default. When on, it watches the screen for errors or warnings inside the phone and speaks up; nothing goes to the cloud. Accessibility must be ON for it.", ["nova", "privacy"]),
("nova-wifi-bluetooth", ["nova wifi on kyun nahi karta", "can nova turn wifi on or off", "wifi bluetooth nova se kaise chalayein", "nova bluetooth khud on kyun nahi karta", "android app wifi ko on off kyun nahi kar sakti", "wifi on karne par settings page kyun khulta hai"],
 "Android kisi app ko Wi-Fi ya Bluetooth khud on-off karne nahi deta. Isliye NOVA us ka Settings page khol deta hai aur wahan aap ek tap se badal sakte ho.",
 "Android does not let an app switch Wi-Fi or Bluetooth on or off itself. So NOVA opens the matching Settings page and you change it with one tap.", ["nova"]),
("nova-language", ["nova ki bhasha kaise badlein", "how to change nova's language", "nova hindi mein jawab kaise de", "nova english mein kaise bole", "awaaz ki bhasha kya hai", "nova ka jawab english mein kaise milega"],
 "Settings mein AWAAZ KI BHASHA se Hindi ya English chuno. Usi ke hisaab se NOVA jawab deta hai.",
 "Choose Hindi or English under AWAAZ KI BHASHA in Settings. NOVA answers in that language.", ["nova"]),
("nova-voice-speed", ["nova ki awaaz tez ya dheemi kaise karein", "how to change nova's voice speed", "nova ki pitch kaise badalte hain", "awaaz test kya hai", "nova ki bolne ki speed kaise badlein", "nova voice pitch setting"],
 "Settings mein BOLNE KI SPEED aur AWAAZ KI PITCH ke slider hilao, phir AWAAZ TEST dabake sunlo.",
 "Move the BOLNE KI SPEED and AWAAZ KI PITCH sliders in Settings, then press AWAAZ TEST to listen.", ["nova"]),
("nova-chat", ["nova se likhkar kaise poochein", "can i type to nova", "nova chat kaise kholte hain", "nova ko text mein sawaal kaise bhejein", "chat box kahan hai nova mein", "nova mein typing se baat kaise karein"],
 "Home par CHAT dabao aur NOVA CHAT mein apna sawaal likho ya mic dabao. Jawab wahin dikhta hai.",
 "Press CHAT on the home screen and type your question in NOVA CHAT, or press the mic. The answer appears there.", ["nova"]),
("nova-knowledge-pack", ["nova offline kaun se sawaalon ke jawab de sakta hai", "what questions can nova answer offline", "nova ka knowledge pack kya hai", "nova general knowledge ke sawaal jaanta hai kya", "offline gk ke jawab nova kaise deta hai", "nova ke andar kya jankari bani hui hai"],
 "NOVA mein India, vigyan, sehat, ganit, rozmarra aur khud NOVA ke baare mein kuch sawaalon ke jawab bundled hain, jo bina internet ke milte hain. Ye sirf text jawab hain, koi action nahi karte. Aaj ki khabar ya bhav jaise live sawaal online jaate hain.",
 "NOVA bundles answers about India, science, health, maths, daily life and NOVA itself, available without the internet. They are text only and never perform actions. Live questions like today's news or prices go online instead.", ["nova"]),
("nova-sleep-mode", ["nova neend mode mein kyun chala jata hai", "sleep mode kya hai nova mein", "what is sleep mode in nova", "nova sirf wake word par kyun jaagta hai", "kaam ke baad nova wapas so jata hai kya", "nova galat wake par kya karta hai"],
 "NOVA sirf wake word sunkar jaagta hai aur kaam khatam hote hi wapas so jata hai. Ek akeli awaaz ya shor se nahi jaagta, aur galat wake par chup-chaap so jata hai.",
 "NOVA wakes only on the wake word and goes back to sleep when the job is done. A lone sound or noise does not wake it, and on a false wake it quietly goes back to sleep.", ["nova"]),
("nova-default-assistant", ["nova ko default assistant kaise banayein", "how to set nova as default assistant", "power button dabake nova kaise jagayein", "home button se nova kaise kholein", "digital assistant app mein nova kaise chunein", "default assistant ka matlab kya hai"],
 "Update Center mein Default assistant dabao, phir Settings ke Digital assistant app mein NOVA chuno. Uske baad Home ya power button dabake rakhne par NOVA jaag jata hai.",
 "Press Default assistant in the Update Center, then choose NOVA under Digital assistant app in Settings. After that, holding the Home or power button wakes NOVA.", ["nova"]),
]
